    <question>
        <text><![CDATA[Beta of cash/risk-free asset is:]]></text>
        <answers>
            <answer correct="yes"><text><![CDATA[0]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[0.5]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[1.0]]></text></answer>
            <answer correct="no"><text><![CDATA[-1.0]]></text></answer>
        </answers>
        <explanation><text><![CDATA[**The Logic:** Cash has no systematic risk => beta = 0.
**The Trap:** Other values misstate cash behaviour.
**Cross-Exam Context:** Same in XV.
**Distributor's Pro-Tip:** Reducing beta to near zero happens by raising cash allocation.]]></text></explanation>
